# Allow only the source and shipped reference inputs into the image.
**
!Dockerfile
!DESCRIPTION
!environment.yml
!renv.lock
!.Rprofile
!LICENSE
!README.md
!renv/
!renv/activate.R
!R/
!R/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!docker/
!docker/**
!applications/
!applications/**/
!applications/**/*.qmd
!applications/**/generate_annotation_metrics.R
!applications/**/LipidDatabase_R.xlsx
!applications/**/seq_*.xlsx
!applications/**/*lipid_reference_set.xlsx
!generic_workflow/
!generic_workflow/**/
!generic_workflow/**/*.qmd
!generic_workflow/LipidDatabase_R.xlsx

# Docker treats trailing directory slashes as path patterns. Apply exclusions
# after directory inclusions so raw data and generated files stay outside the
# context even when a parent directory was included above.
.git
.reviewp
**/data
**/objects
**/mse_*
**/*_files
**/*.mzML
**/*.mzml
**/*.mzXML
**/*.mzxml
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.rds
**/*.RDS
**/*.RData
**/*.Rdata
**/*.html
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.json
**/*.zip
**/*.xlsx
!**/LipidDatabase_R.xlsx
!**/seq_*.xlsx
!**/*lipid_reference_set.xlsx
